# TODO

## Distroless image tagging (from v1.18 / PR 905)

When distroless support is added to this branch, port the following changes
from `jpayne3506/v1.18-1.26Build` (PR #905):

1. **images/Makefile.acn** – Add distroless variables with build-arg hash suffix:
   - `ACN_DISTROLESS_RUNTIME_IMAGE_TAG` and `ACN_DISTROLESS_BUILDER_IMAGE_TAG`
     must include a sha256 hash of `DOCKER_BUILD_ARGS` (and for the builder,
     the distroless runtime image reference) so that build-arg changes produce
     new tags.
   - Add `IMAGE_TAG=` passthrough to `acn-distroless-runtime-image` and
     `acn-distroless-builder-image` targets.
   - Add print helper targets: `print-acn-distroless-runtime-tag`,
     `print-acn-distroless-builder-tag`, `print-acn-distroless-runtime-image`,
     `print-acn-distroless-builder-image`.

2. **`.github/workflows/build-images-ci-acn.yaml`** – Use Makefile.acn print
   targets for distroless image references instead of raw `git ls-tree` or
   `make-image-tag.sh` calls.

3. **`.pipelines/ob/ob-pipeline.yaml`** (PR #903, branch `jpayne/1.26-build`) –
   Distroless tag check and variable setting already use Makefile.acn print
   targets; verify compatibility when distroless is added here.

